# Combining systems
@scenario tutorial_lesson_30
@include /definitions/characters.vns
@label start
[mode dialogue standard]
[set ui.dialogueUi project]
[bg room]
[char ginger global on]
[set ui.dialogueFadeMs 160]
[stage clear]
[show ginger guide shy]
ginger: Your turn to direct. Give me a choice, remember my answer, and let that answer change the light on stage.
ginger: Write the scene, export it, and play both branches from a fresh start.
> Review question -> check
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label check
ginger: Which test checks both branches in the finished build?
> The first frame looks right in the editor. -> retry
> Both routes work from a fresh start in the exported build. -> correct
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label retry
[show ginger guide confused]
ginger: Testing both branches checks the exported scene and its assets. Give it another try.
[jump check]
@label correct
[show ginger guide normal]
ginger: Testing both branches checks the exported scene and its assets.
> Back to topics -> return_hub
> Replay example -> start
@label return_hub
[if !tutorial_done_30]
[flag tutorial_done_30]
[inc tutorial_count]
[endif]
[stage clear]
[goto TutorialHub:topics_page_5]
